        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0420_002_01:ChrEv_0420_002_01_004:28885c06",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0420_002_01:ChrEv_0420_002_01_004:28885c06",
        "jp_sha256": "42cc6f3cfabcc3d941f0066d57aab949a324a4bab73f2856791509940f475d55",
        "official_en_sha256": "b5102d167125566ec8c3303ddbb7d5b8217a69a20c1e434a8070275232df3657"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ふむ……。\r\nならば、もう少し地脈をまわってみるかのう。",
        "official_en": "Is that so? Then we shall continue making our way to the other ley lines.",
        "real_en": null
      },
