        "official_en": "I was unable to refuse her for the debt I owed to her parents. ’Twas not long before the impetuous girl proclaimed herself to be my apprentice.",
        "real_en": "I couldn't bring myself to turn her down, and before I knew it, she'd started calling herself my apprentice without asking."
